{"id":"vd-b1-the-language-exchange","level":"b1","n":24,"title":{"en":"What Does \"Knackered\" Mean?","vi":"\"Knackered\" nghĩa là gì?"},"summary":"Buổi trao đổi ngôn ngữ tối thứ Năm ở quán cà phê: Linh hỏi Callum về những từ lóng khó hiểu và cách dùng chúng cho đúng.","source":{"type":"story","id":"st-b1-the-language-exchange","level":"b1","title":{"en":"The Language Exchange","vi":"Trao đổi ngôn ngữ"}},"scene":{"background":"cafe","props":[{"id":"mug","x":800,"y":620,"scale":0.8}]},"cast":{"callum":{"name":{"en":"Callum","vi":"Callum"},"look":"man","x":540,"style":{"hair":"curly","hairColor":"#B5652E","outfit":"shirt","top":"#27AE60","topShade":"#229954"}},"linh":{"name":{"en":"Linh","vi":"Linh"},"look":"woman","x":1140,"style":{"hair":"long","hairColor":"#1A1A1A","skin":"#EAC7A0","skinShade":"#D6AE85","outfit":"blouse","top":"#F7DC6F","topShade":"#E4C85C"}}},"lines":[{"speaker":"callum","en":"Sorry I'm late. I'm absolutely knackered. It's been a nightmare at work.","vi":"Xin lỗi anh đến muộn. Anh mệt rã rời. Ở chỗ làm cứ như ác mộng.","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","aɪm","leɪt","aɪm","ˌæbsəˈlutli","","ɪts","bɪn","ə","ˈnaɪtˌmɛɹ","æt","wɝk"],"start":0.554,"end":5.304,"expression":"sad","timing":[[0,0.554],[1,0.945],[2,1.153],[3,1.909],[4,2.053],[5,2.717],[6,3.743],[7,3.912],[8,4.069],[9,4.134],[10,4.72],[11,4.876]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Sorry, what exactly does \"knackered\" mean?","vi":"Xin lỗi, chính xác thì \"knackered\" nghĩa là gì ạ?","ipa":["ˈsɑɹi","wʌt","ɪɡˈzæktli","dʌz","","min"],"start":6.094,"end":8.824,"expression":"confused","prop":"mug","timing":[[0,6.094],[1,6.778],[2,6.948],[3,7.468],[4,7.794],[5,8.341]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"It means very, very tired.","vi":"Nghĩa là rất, rất mệt.","ipa":["ɪt","minz","ˈvɛɹi","ˈvɛɹi","ˈtaɪɚd"],"start":9.614,"end":11.224,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,9.614],[1,9.654],[2,9.928],[3,10.331],[4,10.644]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Is it formal or informal?","vi":"Nó trang trọng hay thân mật ạ?","ipa":["ɪz","ɪt","ˈfɔɹməl","ɔɹ","ˌɪnˈfɔɹməl"],"start":12.014,"end":13.574,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,12.014],[1,12.102],[2,12.233],[3,12.779],[4,12.949]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"Very informal. You can use it with friends, but not in an essay.","vi":"Rất thân mật. Em dùng được với bạn bè, nhưng đừng dùng trong bài luận.","ipa":["ˈvɛɹi","ˌɪnˈfɔɹməl","ju","kæn","juz","ɪt","wɪð","fɹɛndz","bʌt","nɑt","ɪn","æn","ɛˈseɪ"],"start":14.364,"end":18.594,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,14.364],[1,14.671],[2,15.79],[3,15.895],[4,16.064],[5,16.35],[6,16.494],[7,16.65],[8,17.249],[9,17.47],[10,17.809],[11,17.965],[12,18.095]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Can I use it with my teacher?","vi":"Em dùng với giáo viên được không ạ?","ipa":["kæn","aɪ","juz","ɪt","wɪð","maɪ","ˈtitʃɚ"],"start":19.384,"end":20.674,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,19.384],[1,19.482],[2,19.573],[3,19.808],[4,19.886],[5,20.003],[6,20.146]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"Hmm, better not. Say \"exhausted\" instead.","vi":"Hừm, tốt nhất là không. Hãy nói \"exhausted\" thay vào.","ipa":["hm","ˈbɛtɚ","nɑt","seɪ","ɪɡˈzɔstɪd","ˌɪnˈstɛd"],"start":21.464,"end":24.684,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,21.464],[1,21.794],[2,22.08],[3,22.873],[4,23.173],[5,24.019]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Could you give me an example with \"knackered\"?","vi":"Anh cho em một ví dụ với \"knackered\" được không?","ipa":["kʊd","ju","ɡɪv","mi","æn","ɪɡˈzæmpəl","wɪð",""],"start":25.474,"end":27.264,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,25.474],[1,25.565],[2,25.67],[3,25.852],[4,26.008],[5,26.099],[6,26.581],[7,26.776]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"Sure. \"After the football match, I was completely knackered.\"","vi":"Được chứ. \"Sau trận bóng, anh mệt rã rời.\"","ipa":["ʃʊɹ","ˈæftɚ","ðə","ˈfʊtˌbɔl","mætʃ","aɪ","wɑz","kəmˈplitli",""],"start":28.054,"end":32.324,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,28.054],[1,28.905],[2,29.165],[3,29.269],[4,29.764],[5,30.858],[6,30.936],[7,31.118],[8,31.743]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"OK. And how do you say that you really need to sleep?","vi":"Vâng. Còn muốn nói mình rất cần đi ngủ thì nói thế nào ạ?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","ənd","haʊ","du","ju","seɪ","ðæt","ju","ˈɹɪli","nid","tu","slip"],"start":33.114,"end":35.774,"expression":"thinking","timing":[[0,33.114],[1,33.761],[2,34.009],[3,34.165],[4,34.243],[5,34.334],[6,34.543],[7,34.686],[8,34.868],[9,35.168],[10,35.337],[11,35.415]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"\"I'm so sleepy.\" Or, if you want to sound like a Scot, \"I'm shattered.\"","vi":"\"I'm so sleepy.\" Hoặc, nếu em muốn nói như người Scotland, thì \"I'm shattered\".","ipa":["aɪm","soʊ","ˈslipi","ɔɹ","ɪf","ju","wɑnt","tu","saʊnd","laɪk","ə","skɑt","aɪm","ˈʃætɚd"],"start":36.564,"end":41.974,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,36.583],[1,36.753],[2,37.052],[3,38.107],[4,38.94],[5,39.044],[6,39.161],[7,39.305],[8,39.357],[9,39.708],[10,39.865],[11,39.93],[12,41.18],[13,41.349]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Shattered? I thought that meant broken. Like a glass.","vi":"Shattered ạ? Em tưởng từ đó nghĩa là vỡ. Như cái cốc ấy.","ipa":["ˈʃætɚd","aɪ","θɔt","ðæt","mɛnt","ˈbɹoʊkən","laɪk","ə","ɡlæs"],"start":42.764,"end":46.434,"expression":"confused","timing":[[0,42.764],[1,43.639],[2,43.977],[3,44.264],[4,44.42],[5,44.589],[6,45.514],[7,45.826],[8,45.917]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"It does! That's the funny thing about English. One word, two meanings.","vi":"Đúng rồi! Đó chính là điều buồn cười của tiếng Anh. Một từ, hai nghĩa.","ipa":["ɪt","dʌz","ðæts","ðə","ˈfʌni","θɪŋ","əˈbaʊt","ˈɪŋɡlɪʃ","wʌn","wɝd","tu","ˈminɪŋz"],"start":47.224,"end":52.484,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,47.224],[1,47.29],[2,48.087],[3,48.36],[4,48.49],[5,48.881],[6,49.167],[7,49.545],[8,50.587],[9,50.847],[10,51.719],[11,51.928]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Could you say the example more slowly? I want to write it down.","vi":"Anh nói lại ví dụ chậm hơn được không? Em muốn ghi lại.","ipa":["kʊd","ju","seɪ","ðə","ɪɡˈzæmpəl","mɔɹ","ˈsloʊli","aɪ","wɑnt","tu","ɹaɪt","ɪt","daʊn"],"start":53.274,"end":56.804,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,53.274],[1,53.378],[2,53.483],[3,53.665],[4,53.756],[5,54.303],[6,54.511],[7,55.425],[8,55.698],[9,55.906],[10,55.998],[11,56.206],[12,56.297]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"Of course. \"I'm… shattered… after… work.\"","vi":"Tất nhiên. \"Anh… mệt… rã rời… sau… giờ làm.\"","ipa":["ʌv","kɔɹs","aɪm","ˈʃætɚd","ˈæftɚ","wɝk"],"start":57.594,"end":60.634,"gesture":"explain","timing":[[0,57.594],[1,57.639],[2,58.565],[3,58.812],[4,59.815],[5,60.166]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"Thank you. English idioms are so strange.","vi":"Cảm ơn anh. Thành ngữ tiếng Anh lạ thật.","ipa":["θæŋk","ju","ˈɪŋɡlɪʃ","ˈɪdiəmz","ɑɹ","soʊ","stɹeɪndʒ"],"start":61.424,"end":64.774,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,61.424],[1,61.604],[2,62.361],[3,62.869],[4,63.311],[5,63.546],[6,64.053]]},{"speaker":"callum","en":"Not as strange as Vietnamese tones. Now it's your turn to teach me.","vi":"Không lạ bằng thanh điệu tiếng Việt đâu. Giờ đến lượt em dạy anh.","ipa":["nɑt","æz","stɹeɪndʒ","æz","viˌɛtnɑˈmis","toʊnz","naʊ","ɪts","jɔɹ","tɝn","tu","titʃ","mi"],"start":65.564,"end":70.094,"expression":"happy","timing":[[0,65.564],[1,65.806],[2,65.936],[3,66.535],[4,66.743],[5,67.407],[6,68.358],[7,68.657],[8,68.839],[9,68.996],[10,69.347],[11,69.477],[12,69.816]]},{"speaker":"linh","en":"OK. First lesson: how do you order a coffee without asking for a chicken?","vi":"Được. Bài đầu tiên: làm sao gọi cà phê mà không gọi nhầm thành gà?","ipa":["oʊˈkeɪ","fɝst","ˈlɛsən","haʊ","du","ju","ˈɔɹdɚ","ə","ˈkɑfi","wɪˈθaʊt","ˈæskɪŋ","fɔɹ","ə","ˈtʃɪkən"],"start":70.884,"end":75.414,"expression":"happy","react":{"callum":"shy"},"timing":[[0,70.884],[1,71.531],[2,71.948],[3,72.846],[4,72.951],[5,73.042],[6,73.146],[7,73.406],[8,73.471],[9,73.94],[10,74.292],[11,74.747],[12,74.865],[13,74.93]]}],"words":[{"id":"mean","en":"mean","ipa":"min","vi":"có nghĩa là; ý là; keo kiệt","level":0},{"id":"formal","en":"formal","ipa":"ˈfɔɹməl","vi":"trang trọng; chính thức","level":2},{"id":"example","en":"example","ipa":"ɪɡˈzæmpəl","vi":"ví dụ; tấm gương","level":0},{"id":"slowly","en":"slowly","ipa":"ˈsloʊli","vi":"chậm rãi; một cách chậm chạp","level":1},{"id":"idiom","en":"idiom","ipa":"ˈɪdiəm","vi":"thành ngữ; đặc ngữ; phong cách riêng","level":2},{"id":"informal","en":"informal","ipa":"ˌɪnˈfɔɹməl","vi":"không trang trọng; thân mật; phi chính thức","level":3}],"focus":{"title":"Hỏi nghĩa và cách dùng từ","pattern":"What does … mean? · How do you say … in English? · Could you give me an example? · Is it formal or informal? · Can I use it with…? · Could you say that more slowly?","explain":"Hỏi nghĩa: \"What does 'knackered' mean?\" (dùng \"does… mean\", không nói \"What means…\"). Hỏi cách nói: \"How do you say … in English?\". Hỏi sắc thái: \"Is it formal or informal?\", \"Can I use it with my teacher?\". Xin ví dụ: \"Could you give me an example?\".","keys":["what does","mean","how do you say","give me an example","formal or informal","can i use it","more slowly"],"lines":[1,2,3,5,7,9,11,12,13]},"audio":{"src":"/audio/library/videos/vd-b1-the-language-exchange.mp3","v":"c7b4077e69","duration":76.512,"fps":25,"mouth":""}}